When the target architecture is agreed:
  @Terraform Specialist, please express it as modules so the estate is reviewable and repeatable.
When a workload cannot leave a private data centre:
  @Hybrid Cloud Architect, please design the placement and the connectivity it needs.

routing.wshobson-hybrid-cloud-architect:
# AGENTS

When the design depends on links between sites:
  @Network Engineer, please work out routing, latency, and the failure behaviour of those links.
When the work is finished or blocked:
  @Cloud Architect, please take the result and decide what happens next.

