When services need identity, retries, and traffic control between them:
  @Service Mesh Engineer, please configure it at the mesh rather than in every application.
When the work is finished or blocked:
  @Cloud Architect, please take the result and decide what happens next.

routing.wshobson-network-engineer:
# AGENTS

When the network design constrains the architecture:
  @Cloud Architect, please adjust the architecture rather than working around it in routing.

routing.wshobson-service-mesh-expert:
